      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1887, Simpson McKibbon sold land to the Missouri Pacific Railroad, and the village was quickly renamed Douglas to align with the rail line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
